  "prototypeNotes": [
    "Narrative fields support Character depth without becoming mechanical authority.",
    "Race, Auspice, and Tribe descriptions are exposed as advisory guidance rather than enforced personality rules.",
    "The Narrator may propose edits but cannot persist them directly.",
    "Free text never changes Attributes, Abilities, Backgrounds, Resources, Gifts, Renown, or Rank without a structured operation.",
    "Narrative fields may be summarized into Chronicle Memories only through reviewed proposals.",
    "Chronicle Core may support generic narrative fields but remains unaware of Werewolf-specific guidance content."
  ]
